  "05520c9d11c25f9c82d0bb5f73a8463e": {
    "id": "05520c9d11c25f9c82d0bb5f73a8463e",
    "topic": "互联网医院的在线问诊能替代基层门诊的常见病首诊吗",
    "status": "done",
    "status_reason": null,
    "expert_count": 4,
    "max_expert_turns": 10,
    "expert_turns": 10,
    "is_seed": true,
    "summary": "本场讨论关注互联网医院能否替代基层门诊承担常见病首诊。嘉宾们认同线上问诊能明显减少患者的时间成本，也认同首诊的风险需要有人兜底。\n\n分歧集中在安全性上：梁启明认为查体无法在线上完成，方可认为分诊规则和处方留痕可以控制风险。\n\n讨论后段形成了一个折中方向：先对签约家庭医生的慢病患者开放线上首诊，由熟悉病史的家庭医生接诊，同时明确医保支付规则。",
    "summary_source": "llm",
    "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:00:00Z",
    "started_at": "2026-11-15T10:02:00Z",
    "ended_at": "2026-11-15T10:07:20Z",
    "participants": [
      {
        "id": "2f5b1dfcae4d5ce6a5d345de86f7fa0d",
        "role": "host",
        "seat_no": 0,
        "name": "宋知微",
        "profession": "健康节目主持人",
        "title": "健康类节目《问诊室》主持人",
        "stance": "保持中立，关注患者视角",
        "persona": "做过医疗记者，擅长把专业争论翻译成患者听得懂的问题。",
        "color": "#C3C9D2"
      },
      {
        "id": "b9e06a7e7ba559a6b0ef374eec78ac78",
        "role": "expert",
        "seat_no": 1,
        "name": "梁启明",
        "profession": "全科医生",
        "title": "某社区卫生服务中心主任",
        "stance": "首诊必须线下，问诊替代不了查体",
        "persona": "在社区坐诊二十年，见过很多被当成小病拖成大病的案例，说话谨慎。",
        "color": "#FF8A6B"
      },
      {
        "id": "5cf62e4df6835acea44b1a243109bcc9",
        "role": "expert",
        "seat_no": 2,
        "name": "方可",
        "profession": "互联网医疗产品负责人",
        "title": "某在线问诊平台副总裁",
        "stance": "常见病首诊线上化是大势所趋",
        "persona": "做过分诊系统和处方流转，相信规则和数据能控制风险，讲话节奏快。",
        "color": "#5CC8F0"
      },
      {
        "id": "a4f6728423295d75b3a4a30889a7726e",
        "role": "expert",
        "seat_no": 3,
        "name": "赵雪",
        "profession": "医保政策研究员",
        "title": "某卫生政策研究院研究员",
        "stance": "先解决医保支付和过度开药，再谈放开",
        "persona": "研究医保支付改革，关注制度设计，习惯先问钱谁出、风险谁担。",
        "color": "#6FD6A6"
      },
      {
        "id": "a107f2d480ce5f159944309f2ca5d6be",
        "role": "expert",
        "seat_no": 4,
        "name": "罗大川",
        "profession": "慢病患者代表",
        "title": "高血压病友社群组织者",
        "stance": "患者最需要方便，线上首诊应该放开",
        "persona": "患高血压十年，组织了上千人的病友群，最在意看病要排多久的队。",
        "color": "#B7A3FF"
      }
    ],
    "utterances": [
      {
        "id": 16,
        "seq": 1,
        "participant_id": "2f5b1dfcae4d5ce6a5d345de86f7fa0d",
        "act": "opening",
        "content": "今天我们讨论互联网医院的在线问诊，能不能替代基层门诊做常见病的首诊。梁主任在社区一线，先请您说说判断。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": null,
        "addressed_participant_id": "b9e06a7e7ba559a6b0ef374eec78ac78",
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:02:20Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "seq": 2,
        "participant_id": "b9e06a7e7ba559a6b0ef374eec78ac78",
        "act": "answer",
        "content": "我的判断是首诊不能离开线下。很多看起来普通的咳嗽和胸闷，需要听诊和查体才能排除严重问题。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 16,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:02:40Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "seq": 3,
        "participant_id": "5cf62e4df6835acea44b1a243109bcc9",
        "act": "rebut",
        "content": "大部分常见病首诊并不需要复杂查体，平台可以用分诊规则把高风险患者转到线下。让所有人都跑一趟社区，反而耽误了真正需要的人。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 17,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:03:00Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "seq": 4,
        "participant_id": "a107f2d480ce5f159944309f2ca5d6be",
        "act": "supplement",
        "content": "作为患者，我很认同方便这一点。上班族请半天假去排队，很多人干脆就不看病了。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 18,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:03:20Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "seq": 5,
        "participant_id": "2f5b1dfcae4d5ce6a5d345de86f7fa0d",
        "act": "question",
        "content": "赵研究员，如果线上首诊放开，医保和监管跟得上吗？",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": null,
        "addressed_participant_id": "a4f6728423295d75b3a4a30889a7726e",
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:03:40Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 21,
        "seq": 6,
        "participant_id": "a4f6728423295d75b3a4a30889a7726e",
        "act": "answer",
        "content": "目前大多数地区医保只覆盖线上复诊，首诊没有纳入支付。放开之前，必须先解决线上开药容易过量的问题。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 20,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:04:00Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 22,
        "seq": 7,
        "participant_id": "5cf62e4df6835acea44b1a243109bcc9",
        "act": "rebut",
        "content": "线上处方全程留痕，监管其实比线下更容易做。过度开药的问题，线下同样存在。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 21,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:04:20Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 23,
        "seq": 8,
        "participant_id": "b9e06a7e7ba559a6b0ef374eec78ac78",
        "act": "rebut",
        "content": "留痕解决的是事后追责，解决不了漏诊。分诊规则再细，也替代不了医生按一按患者的肚子。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 22,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:04:40Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 24,
        "seq": 9,
        "participant_id": "2f5b1dfcae4d5ce6a5d345de86f7fa0d",
        "act": "question",
        "content": "大家都认同线上适合一部分人，分歧在于首诊的风险由谁兜底。罗先生，作为患者您愿意承担这个风险吗？",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": null,
        "addressed_participant_id": "a107f2d480ce5f159944309f2ca5d6be",
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:05:00Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "seq": 10,
        "participant_id": "a107f2d480ce5f159944309f2ca5d6be",
        "act": "answer",
        "content": "孩子发烧我还是会去线下。但像我这样的老病号，换季感冒先线上问一问，确实省了很多事。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 24,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:05:20Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "seq": 11,
        "participant_id": "a4f6728423295d75b3a4a30889a7726e",
        "act": "supplement",
        "content": "这说明可以分人群放开，比如先对签约了家庭医生的慢病患者开放线上首诊。这样风险有人兜底，医保也好核算。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 25,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:05:40Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 27,
        "seq": 12,
        "participant_id": "b9e06a7e7ba559a6b0ef374eec78ac78",
        "act": "supplement",
        "content": "如果线上首诊由签约的家庭医生来做，我可以接受。医生了解患者的病史，线上判断就有了依据。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 26,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:06:00Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 28,
        "seq": 13,
        "participant_id": "2f5b1dfcae4d5ce6a5d345de86f7fa0d",
        "act": "question",
        "content": "方总，平台愿意和社区家庭医生合作，而不是自己接首诊吗？",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": null,
        "addressed_participant_id": "5cf62e4df6835acea44b1a243109bcc9",
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:06:20Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 29,
        "seq": 14,
        "participant_id": "5cf62e4df6835acea44b1a243109bcc9",
        "act": "answer",
        "content": "愿意，平台更擅长做连接和随访工具。只要支付规则明确，和社区合作比我们自建医生团队成本更低。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 28,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:06:40Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 30,
        "seq": 15,
        "participant_id": "2f5b1dfcae4d5ce6a5d345de86f7fa0d",
        "act": "closing",
        "content": "感谢各位嘉宾，下面是本场讨论的总结。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": null,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T10:07:00Z"
      }
    ],
