    ],
    "utterances": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "seq": 1,
        "participant_id": "cd77d5340fd05e00908876079c2e4fde",
        "act": "opening",
        "content": "欢迎来到今天的圆桌，我们讨论生成式 AI 会不会让初级程序员岗位消失。四位嘉宾立场各不相同，先请林老师谈谈您看到的数据。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": null,
        "addressed_participant_id": "3b40f25c312354beb6758f5a2f7b2927",
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:02:20Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "seq": 2,
        "participant_id": "3b40f25c312354beb6758f5a2f7b2927",
        "act": "answer",
        "content": "我们跟踪的招聘数据显示，初级开发岗位的发布量比两年前明显下降。企业正在用 AI 工具替代原本交给新人的重复编码工作。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 1,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:02:40Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "seq": 3,
        "participant_id": "93227b6e11ef5f798875656947571465",
        "act": "rebut",
        "content": "招聘发布量下降有经济周期的因素，不能全算在 AI 头上。我身边用 AI 的新手，三个月就能独立交付以前要半年才能上手的功能。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 2,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:03:00Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "seq": 4,
        "participant_id": "cf90d8033c3e52d6b5816ddb30613f1f",
        "act": "supplement",
        "content": "新手上手确实变快了，但我们的招聘标准也跟着变了。现在招初级工程师，我更看重他能不能审查 AI 写出来的代码。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 3,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:03:20Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "seq": 5,
        "participant_id": "cd77d5340fd05e00908876079c2e4fde",
        "act": "question",
        "content": "何老师，按陈总的说法，企业要的是会审代码的新人，学校现在教得出来吗？",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": null,
        "addressed_participant_id": "6469f827c0845f02b31e2ed1f8097889",
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:03:40Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "seq": 6,
        "participant_id": "6469f827c0845f02b31e2ed1f8097889",
        "act": "answer",
        "content": "坦白说大部分学校还教不出来，课程仍以手写基础代码为主。我们今年开始把代码审查和 AI 协作写进实训课，但进度比行业慢。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 5,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:04:00Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "seq": 7,
        "participant_id": "3b40f25c312354beb6758f5a2f7b2927",
        "act": "supplement",
        "content": "这正是我担心的地方：岗位门槛抬高了，培养体系却跟不上，最先被挤出去的是普通院校的毕业生。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 6,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:04:20Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "seq": 8,
        "participant_id": "93227b6e11ef5f798875656947571465",
        "act": "rebut",
        "content": "门槛抬高的同时，个人做产品的门槛也降低了。不进大厂，新人也可以靠 AI 接外包、做独立产品。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 7,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:04:40Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "seq": 9,
        "participant_id": "cd77d5340fd05e00908876079c2e4fde",
        "act": "question",
        "content": "目前大家都认可新人的能力要求在变，分歧在于岗位总量是减少还是转移。陈总，您怎么看许安说的独立开发这条路？",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": null,
        "addressed_participant_id": "cf90d8033c3e52d6b5816ddb30613f1f",
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:05:00Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "seq": 10,
        "participant_id": "cf90d8033c3e52d6b5816ddb30613f1f",
        "act": "answer",
        "content": "独立开发只适合少数人，大多数新人还是需要在团队里积累工程经验。我们明年的初级岗位会减少一些，但不会清零。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 9,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:05:20Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "seq": 11,
        "participant_id": "3b40f25c312354beb6758f5a2f7b2927",
        "act": "rebut",
        "content": "「减少一些」乘以整个行业，就是一大批毕业生找不到第一份工作。这不是转移，是实打实的缩减。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 10,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:05:40Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "seq": 12,
        "participant_id": "6469f827c0845f02b31e2ed1f8097889",
        "act": "supplement",
        "content": "所以学校不能只等企业给岗位，要让学生在校期间就做出能上线的项目。有作品的学生，在缩减的市场里依然有竞争力。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 11,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:06:00Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "seq": 13,
        "participant_id": "cd77d5340fd05e00908876079c2e4fde",
        "act": "question",
        "content": "许安，如果你现在是一名应届生，你会怎么做？",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": null,
        "addressed_participant_id": "93227b6e11ef5f798875656947571465",
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:06:20Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "seq": 14,
        "participant_id": "93227b6e11ef5f798875656947571465",
        "act": "answer",
        "content": "我会先用 AI 把一个完整项目做上线，再拿它当求职作品。会用 AI 的新人不怕岗位少，怕的是只会背题。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": 13,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:06:40Z"
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "seq": 15,
        "participant_id": "cd77d5340fd05e00908876079c2e4fde",
        "act": "closing",
        "content": "感谢四位嘉宾的交锋，下面我来回顾今天的共识和分歧。",
        "reply_to_utterance_id": null,
        "addressed_participant_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T09:07:00Z"
      }
    ],
